# global-testing

> **Purpose:** Prove the deterministic parts work, without calling live services.
>
> **Applies to:** All test files in every workspace.

## What to test
- Every util in `utils/`.
- The difficulty rule: every factor and every score band.
- The quote verifier: match, no match, whitespace and case differences.
- Zod schemas in `@stamp/schema`: one valid and one invalid example each.
- Agent nodes: with saved page fixtures.

## How
- Use Vitest.
- Never call OpenAI, Tavily or provider endpoints in tests. Use fixtures or mocks.
- Keep fixtures in a `fixtures/` folder next to the tests.
- Name tests by behaviour: "downgrades a claim when the quote is missing".
- One behaviour per test.

## Hygiene
- `pnpm test` must pass before every commit.
- Never skip or delete a failing test to make a build pass.
